<rml>
<head>
<title>Wyświetlacz peronowy</title>
<!--
Example (TSRE displays): a platform screen with a clock.

Shapes: wyswietlacz_zegar_wiszacy_1.sd and wyswietlacz_peron_zegar_wiszacy.sd,
both faces: squares (1040 x 500, Surface Glass, RefreshRate 1, Input
Platform) over each face's LCD.

Shows:
- the platform's next train (display.trains' first: the platform's trains,
  each once, in the order they come): leaving, its departure and
  destination (the train's own, else its last stop's station); ending
  here, its arrival and origin; the platform, the train (its fields, else
  its timetable name);
- when it leaves or arrives: in how many minutes, by TSRE's functions
  add_minutes (the booked time plus the delay) and minutes_until (from the
  clock, display.clock); a late train's delay and its expected time;
- its cars from the front (row.cars: the platform's next two trains have
  them): a box a vehicle with its number, the loco with a rounded nose,
  the colour by its tags (has): first class yellow, second light,
  restaurant red, sleeping and couchette blue;
- an analog clock whose hands turn by display.hours, minutes and seconds
  (CSS transforms bound to them), the date under it (format_date, the day's
  name in Polish).

Data binding and TSRE's functions; no Lua.
-->
<style>
body, div {
    display: block;
}
span {
    display: inline;
}
body {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #050608;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: Noto Sans;
}

/* The next departure. */
#panel {
    position: absolute;
    left: 4%;
    top: 7%;
    width: 62%;
    height: 86%;
    padding: 18px 22px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background-color: #0d2b8c;
}
.head {
    font-size: 56px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.time {
    margin-right: 22px;
}
.label {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: #c3cff5;
    font-size: 18px;
}
.value {
    font-size: 30px;
}
.late {
    color: #ffcc33;
}
.train {
    position: absolute;
    left: 22px;
    bottom: 16px;
    font-size: 30px;
    font-weight: bold;
}
.operator {
    margin-right: 10px;
    color: #c3cff5;
    font-size: 22px;
}

/* The next train's cars from its front: a box a vehicle, its number on
   it. An engine dark, its nose rounded at the train's front or rear; the
   colour by the tags after that (an EMU's power car carries passengers). */
.cars {
    position: absolute;
    left: 22px;
    right: 22px;
    bottom: 66px;
    height: 44px;
    display: flex;
}
.car {
    flex: 1;
    margin-right: 4px;
    height: 44px;
    line-height: 44px;
    background-color: #9aa3b5;
    color: #0d1424;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-align: center;
}
.car.loco {
    background-color: #2a303c;
    color: #ffffff;
}
.car.front {
    border-radius: 20px 0 0 20px;
}
.car.back {
    border-radius: 0 20px 20px 0;
}
.car.first {
    background-color: #f2c200;
    color: #0d1424;
}
.car.second {
    background-color: #eef1f6;
    color: #0d1424;
}
.car.restaurant {
    background-color: #d83a34;
    color: #ffffff;
}
.car.sleeping {
    background-color: #3a6ee8;
    color: #ffffff;
}

/* The clock: a face, twelve ticks, three hands. */
#face {
    position: absolute;
    left: 713px;
    top: 75px;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border-radius: 150px;
    background-color: #f2f2ee;
}
.tick {
    position: absolute;
    left: 147px;
    top: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 300px;
}
.tick div {
    height: 29px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
/* The ticks after the top one, 30 degrees apart. */
.h1 {
    transform: rotate(30deg);
}
.h2 {
    transform: rotate(60deg);
}
.h3 {
    transform: rotate(90deg);
}
.h4 {
    transform: rotate(120deg);
}
.h5 {
    transform: rotate(150deg);
}
.h6 {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
}
.h7 {
    transform: rotate(210deg);
}
.h8 {
    transform: rotate(240deg);
}
.h9 {
    transform: rotate(270deg);
}
.h10 {
    transform: rotate(300deg);
}
.h11 {
    transform: rotate(330deg);
}
.hand {
    position: absolute;
    transform-origin: 50% 100%;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
#hour {
    left: 144px;
    top: 73px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 77px;
}
#minute {
    left: 146px;
    top: 30px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 120px;
}
#second {
    left: 148px;
    top: 21px;
    width: 4px;
    height: 129px;
    background-color: #c01818;
}
#pin {
    position: absolute;
    left: 141px;
    top: 141px;
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
}
#date {
    position: absolute;
    left: 713px;
    top: 392px;
    width: 300px;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 30px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body data-model="display">

<div id="panel">
    <div data-for="row, i : trains">
        <div data-if="i == 0">
            <!-- Leaving: its departure and where it goes; ending here: its
                 arrival and where it comes from. -->
            <div class="head" data-if="row.departs != ''">
                <span class="time">{{row.departs}}</span>
                <span>{{row.destination}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="head" data-if="row.departs == ''">
                <span class="time">{{row.arrives}}</span>
                <span>{{row.origin}}</span>
            </div>

            <div class="label">Peron / Platform</div>
            <div class="value">{{platform}}</div>

            <div data-if="row.departs != ''">
                <div class="label">Odjazd / Departure</div>
                <div class="value" data-if="(row.departs | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)) > 0">
                    za {{row.departs | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)}} min
                </div>
                <div class="value" data-if="(row.departs | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)) &lt;= 0">
                    odjeżdża / departing
                </div>
            </div>
            <div data-if="row.departs == ''">
                <div class="label">Przyjazd / Arrival</div>
                <div class="value" data-if="(row.arrives | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)) > 0">
                    za {{row.arrives | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)}} min
                </div>
                <div class="value" data-if="(row.arrives | add_minutes(row.delay) | minutes_until(clock)) &lt;= 0">
                    przyjeżdża / arriving
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="value late" data-if="row.delay != ''">
                opóźnienie {{row.delay}} min, ok. {{row.time | add_minutes(row.delay)}}
            </div>

            <!-- Its cars from the front. -->
            <div class="cars">
                <div class="car" data-for="v : row.cars"
                     data-class-loco="v.kind == 'engine'"
                     data-class-front="v.kind == 'engine' &amp;&amp; v.index == 0"
                     data-class-back="v.kind == 'engine' &amp;&amp; v.index &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; v.index == row.cars.size - 1"
                     data-class-first="v.tags | has('A')"
                     data-class-second="v.tags | has('B')"
                     data-class-restaurant="v.tags | has('WR')"
                     data-class-sleeping="(v.tags | has('WL')) || (v.tags | has('BC'))">{{v.number}}</div>
            </div>

            <!-- The train's fields where it has them, else its timetable name. -->
            <div class="train" data-if="row.operator != '' || row.category != '' || row.line != ''">
                <span class="operator">{{row.operator}}</span>
                {{row.category}} {{row.number}} {{row.line}} {{row.name}}
            </div>
            <div class="train" data-if="row.operator == '' &amp;&amp; row.category == '' &amp;&amp; row.line == ''">
                {{row.id}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="face">
    <div class="tick"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h1"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h2"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h3"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h4"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h5"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h6"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h7"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h8"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h9"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h10"><div></div></div>
    <div class="tick h11"><div></div></div>
    <div class="hand" id="hour" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + (hours * 30 + minutes * 0.5) + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div class="hand" id="minute" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + (minutes * 6 + seconds * 0.1) + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div class="hand" id="second" data-style-transform="'rotate(' + seconds * 6 + 'deg)'"></div>
    <div id="pin"></div>
</div>
<div id="date">{{date | format_date('ddd dd.MM.yyyy', 'pl')}}</div>

</body>
</rml>
